      "description": "DocutenModule (src/Dtd.Api/Modules/DocutenModule.cs). Integración con Docuten fuera del flujo de documentos: el webhook anónimo /callback (Docuten notifica estados del lote/shipments) y el listado de callbacks recibidos, con filtro por documentoId.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Callback (webhook simulado)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/docuten/callback", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "docuten", "callback"] },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"lot_id\": \"LOT-123456\",\n  \"status\": \"completed\",\n  \"shipments\": [\n    {\n      \"shipment_id\": \"SHP-1\",\n      \"shipment_status\": \"completed\",\n      \"shipment_signature_status\": \"signed\",\n      \"proof_of_delivery\": \"https://docuten.example/pod/SHP-1.pdf\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"shipment_id\": \"SHP-2\",\n      \"shipment_status\": \"pending_delivery\",\n      \"shipment_signature_status\": \"unsigned\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"event\": \"lot.status_changed\",\n  \"occurred_at\": \"2026-08-27T12:34:56Z\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "description": "Simula la notificación de Docuten. Endpoint anónimo (AllowAnonymous): siempre responde 200 { received, processed } para no generar reintentos; procesa el payload vía ProcesarCallbackDocuten (matchea lot/shipment contra documentos y registra en el log de callbacks). Mira la consola del API para ver el payload completo."
          },
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
            "pm.test('received=true', () => { const b = pm.response.json(); pm.expect(b.received).to.be.true; });"
          ] } }],
          "response": [{ "name": "200 OK", "status": "OK", "code": 200, "body": "{\n  \"received\": true,\n  \"processed\": true,\n  \"type\": \"lot\",\n  \"documentoId\": \"a1b2c3d4-0001-4ddd-8c0d-2b1d1d000000\"\n}" }]
        },
        {
          "name": "Listar callbacks recibidos",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/docuten/callbacks?documentoId=&limit=50",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "docuten", "callbacks"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "documentoId", "value": "", "description": "opcional (Guid) — filtra por documento" },
                { "key": "limit", "value": "50", "description": "opcional (max 200, default 50)" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Lista los callbacks de Docuten capturados (log persistido), con su estado de procesamiento."
          },
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [ "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));" ] } }],
          "response": [{ "name": "200 OK", "status": "OK", "code": 200, "body": "[\n  {\n    \"id\": \"7b2c3d4c-0001-4ddd-8c0d-2b1d1d000080\",\n    \"recibidoEn\": \"2026-08-27T12:35:00+00:00\",\n    \"tipo\": \"lot\",\n    \"documentoId\": \"a1b2c3d4-0001-4ddd-8c0d-2b1d1d000000\",\n    \"lotId\": \"LOT-123456\",\n    \"lotReference\": null,\n    \"shipmentId\": \"SHP-1\",\n    \"shipmentReference\": null,\n    \"event\": \"lot.status_changed\",\n    \"estado\": \"completed\",\n    \"procesado\": true,\n    \"payload\": \"{\\\"lot_id\\\":\\\"LOT-123456\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"completed\\\"}\",\n    \"headers\": \"Content-Type=application/json\",\n    \"mensaje\": null\n  }\n]" }]
        }
      ]
    },
